# Changes to these files wait for a council member's review (council poll P35, 2026-11-10) once branch protection requires code owners' reviews
# (tools/ci/protect_pipeline.sh, docs/security.md). They are what builds, signs and ships releases, the code that
# checks downloads before installing them (backend.rs downloads, installs and updates the launcher itself; links.json
# says where from; the Cargo.toml files pick the crates that do it), and this file. Everything else merges as soon as
# `verify` passes. Also listed: the code that fetches and verifies SDKs, the launcher's self-update installer, the
# download-URL resolution and the build configuration (`.cargo/`, `xtask/`, which packs the release archives).
